+# SPR-0004B.5 Integration
+
+1. Ensure the target branch is `develop` and the working tree is clean.
+2. Apply `SPR-0004B.5.patch` from the repository root:
+
+```bash
+git apply --check SPR-0004B.5.patch
+git apply SPR-0004B.5.patch
+```
+
+3. Review the manifest and build all four normal firmware environments listed in `docs/testing/SPR-0004B.5-validation.md`.
+4. Flash and validate ESP32-WROOM first with Display CAN.
+5. Validate profile persistence and the Standard-CAN no-op behaviour.
+6. Repeat profile/configuration validation on LilyGO.
+7. Commit only after the validation checklist passes.
+
+No AWS deployment is required for this sprint.
